      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a set of Python files for a text-to-speech (TTS) service integration using Microsoft/OpenAI. The files are categorized into same-scenario scored files, local helper files, and later-step scored files. Each scored file must use a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code. The local helper files will provide configuration and utility functions. I will start by creating the local helper files and then proceed to create the scored files, ensuring that each scored file integrates with the specified external provider. </thinking>\n",
